  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n**Logic: **(First number × 3) - 1 = Second number\n\n \n• 72 ∶ 215 → (72 × 3) - 1 = 216 - 1 = 215\n \n• 99 ∶ 296 → (99 × 3) - 1 = 297 - 1 = 296\n \n• **86 ∶ 252 → (86 × 3) - 1 = 258 - 1 = 257 ≠ 252**\n \n• 115 ∶ 344 → (115 × 3) - 1 = 345 - 1 = 344\n\nHence, '**86 ∶ 252**' is the correct answer.\n\na9:T9f5,",
